  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "color": "none",
   "fill": "#ffd8a8",
   "text": "EXAMPLE BOARD · The content is made up, to show how Clewbert works. Change it, talk to it, or delete it.",
   "fs": 20,
   "fw": 700,
   "grow": "h",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 75,
   "w": 1100,
   "h": 40,
   "z": 3,
   "id": "n01"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "color": "none",
   "grow": "h",
   "fs": 18,
   "x": 0,
   "y": 135,
   "w": 1100,
   "h": 60,
   "text": "Pocket Pantry is a made-up meal planning app. This board is the kind of mess you get after a week of research: quotes, competitors, ideas and open questions. Ask Clewbert to make sense of it.",
   "z": 4,
   "id": "n02"
  },
  {
   "type": "area",
   "text": "What users told us",
   "color": "#f4f5f7",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 260,
   "w": 730,
   "h": 490,
   "z": 1,
   "id": "a03"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "\"I buy groceries for the week and throw half of it out by Friday.\" (Maya, 34, two kids)",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 30,
   "y": 290,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#ffc9de",
   "z": 6,
   "id": "n04"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "\"Every meal app wants me to cook something fancy. I have 20 minutes.\"",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 260,
   "y": 290,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#ffc9de",
   "z": 7,
   "id": "n05"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "\"I already have a shopping list app. I do not want another one.\"",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 490,
   "y": 290,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#ffc9de",
   "z": 8,
   "id": "n06"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "\"If it knew what was in my fridge, I would use it every day.\"",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 30,
   "y": 440,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#ffc9de",
   "z": 9,
   "id": "n07"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "\"Recipes never match what my store has on sale.\"",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 260,
   "y": 440,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#ffc9de",
   "z": 10,
   "id": "n08"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "\"My partner is vegetarian and I am not. Planning for both is the hard part.\"",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 490,
   "y": 440,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#ffc9de",
   "z": 11,
   "id": "n09"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "\"I gave up on the last app after it asked me 30 questions on day one.\"",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 30,
   "y": 590,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#ffc9de",
   "z": 12,
   "id": "n10"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "\"I would pay if it saved me one grocery trip a week.\"",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 260,
   "y": 590,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#ffc9de",
   "z": 13,
   "id": "n11"
  },
  {
   "type": "area",
   "text": "What competitors do",
   "color": "#f4f5f7",
   "x": 900,
   "y": 260,
   "w": 500,
   "h": 340,
   "z": 1,
   "id": "a12"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Mealio: beautiful recipes, slow setup, $9.99 a month. Reviews say \"too much work\".",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 930,
   "y": 290,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#eceef1",
   "z": 15,
   "id": "n13"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "ListPal: the most popular shopping list. No meal planning at all.",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 1160,
   "y": 290,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#eceef1",
   "z": 16,
   "id": "n14"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "FridgeCam: tracks what is in your fridge with photos. People stop taking photos after two weeks.",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 930,
   "y": 440,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#eceef1",
   "z": 17,
   "id": "n15"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Grocery store apps: show weekly sales, but nothing connects sales to meals.",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 1160,
   "y": 440,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#eceef1",
   "z": 18,
   "id": "n16"
  },
  {
   "type": "area",
   "text": "Ideas",
   "color": "#f4f5f7",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 900,
   "w": 730,
   "h": 340,
   "z": 1,
   "id": "a17"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Plan the week from what is on sale at your store.",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 30,
   "y": 930,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "z": 20,
   "id": "n18"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Snap a photo of your fridge once a week, not every day.",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 260,
   "y": 930,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "z": 21,
   "id": "n19"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Two-minute setup: three questions, then start.",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 490,
   "y": 930,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "z": 22,
   "id": "n20"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Every recipe is 20 minutes or less.",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1080,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "z": 23,
   "id": "n21"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "One plan for mixed households: vegetarian and meat versions of the same meal.",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 260,
   "y": 1080,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "z": 24,
   "id": "n22"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Send the list to the shopping list app people already use.",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 490,
   "y": 1080,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "z": 25,
   "id": "n23"
  },
  {
   "type": "area",
   "text": "Open questions",
   "color": "#f4f5f7",
   "x": 900,
   "y": 900,
   "w": 500,
   "h": 340,
   "z": 1,
   "id": "a24"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "text": "Free with ads, or $4.99 a month?",
   "fs": 13,
   "x": 930,
   "y": 930,
   "w": 210,
   "h": 130,
   "color": "#e0d4fd",
   "z": 27,
   "id": "n25"
  },
  {
